  ('ACNE_VULGARIS', 'OBSERVATION', 'Comedones (open/closed) distinguish acne from rosacea and folliculitis.', '{}'::text[], NULL, '{}'::text[], 'Reynolds RV, Yeung H, Cheng CE, et al. Guidelines of care for the management of acne vulgaris. J Am Acad Dermatol. 2024;90(5):1006.e1-1006.e30. [citation to be verified by reviewer]', 0),
